<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>{{body.subject}}</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; margin: 20px;
      padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f8f8; } .container { background-color:
      #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0,
      0, 0.1); } .status { margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid
      #007BFF; background-color: #e9f5ff; } .logo-box{ text-align: center; }
      .logo { width: 100px; } .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px;
      color: #777; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='logo-box'>
        <img class='logo' src='{{logoPath}}' alt='' />
      </div>
      <h2>Hello {{body.employerName}}, </h2>
      <p>Here is the status update for employee:
        <strong>{{body.employeeName}}</strong>.</p>

      <div class='status'>
        <strong>Face Match Status:</strong>
        {{body.faceMatchStatus}}
      </div>
      <div class='status'>
        <strong>Fingerprint Status:</strong>
        {{body.fingerprintStatus}}
      </div>
      <div class='status'>
        <strong>Name Status:</strong>
        {{body.nameStatus}}
      </div>
      <div class='status'>
        <strong>Date of Birth Status:</strong>
        {{body.dobStatus}}
      </div>

      <p>If you have any further questions, feel free to reach out.</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br />Base</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>